@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-02 Manage Inquiry

|Customer|
start
:[Step 1.0] Select "Inquiries" / "Contact Us" on website\n(or AI Chatbot conversation escalates);
:[Step 1.0] Fill out inquiry form\n(name, contact details, email, message);
:[Step 2.0] Submit inquiry;

|System|
:[Step 1.1] Validate that all required fields are completed;

if (All required fields valid?) then (Yes)
  :[Step 1.2] Create new inquiry record with status "Open"\nand assign a reference number;
  :[Step 2.1] Display confirmation message with reference number;
  :[Step 2.2] Add inquiry to Staff/Admin dashboard queue;

  |Staff/Admin|
  :[Step 3.0] Open inquiry from dashboard and review details;

  |System|
  :[Step 3.1] Display inquiry details and related order/account history;

  |Staff/Admin|
  :[Step 4.0] Draft and send reply to customer;

  |System|
  :[Step 4.1] Deliver reply via email and\nupdate inquiry status to "Answered";

  |Customer|
  :[Step 5.0] Read reply;

  if (Customer responds again or needs further help?) then (Yes)
    :[Step 5.0] Send follow-up response;
    
    |Staff/Admin|
    :[Step 4.0] Review follow-up and draft another reply;
    
    |System|
    :[Step 4.1] Update inquiry status to "Answered";
    
    |Customer|
    :[Step 5.0] Read updated response;
  else (No)
  endif

  |System|
  if (No further response within set period or Staff/Admin closes it?) then (Yes)
    :[Step 5.1] Update inquiry status to "Closed";
  else (No)
    :Keep inquiry active;
  endif

else (No)
  |System|
  :[Exc 1.1.1] Highlight invalid/missing fields and\nprevent submission until corrected;
  
  |Customer|
  :[Step 1.0] Correct details and resubmit;
endif

|System|
stop
@enduml
